WEBVTT

1
00:00:16.963 --> 00:00:19.105
daybreak the storm had stopped.

2
00:00:20.346 --> 00:00:24.489
The Little Mermaid swam to a beach, pulling the Prince through the water.

3
00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:29.153
Then she stretched the Prince out on the white sand.

4
00:00:29.173 --> 00:00:32.456
"You're safe now," she told him.

5
00:00:33.696 --> 00:00:36.177
But he was not awake and could not hear her.

6
00:00:37.477 --> 00:00:38.417
She looked around.

7
00:00:39.158 --> 00:00:43.319
She was in a little cove, with a small garden just beyond the beach.

8
00:00:44.639 --> 00:00:49.960
The garden had white benches surrounded by fragrant lemon and orange trees.

9
00:00:51.401 --> 00:00:54.902
Just behind the garden, she saw a large brick building.

10
00:00:54.922 --> 00:01:00.703
"It has such a tall tower and such big wooden doors!"

11
00:01:01.364 --> 00:01:02.464
cried the Little Mermaid.

12
00:01:03.824 --> 00:01:08.028
She held the Prince's head and ran her fingers through his wet hair.

13
00:01:08.048 --> 00:01:12.491
"Please wake up, my Prince," said the Little Mermaid.

14
00:01:13.592 --> 00:01:15.393
But his eyes remained closed.

15
00:01:15.413 --> 00:01:21.578
"As you sleep, the sun will warm you," she lovingly told the Prince.

16
00:01:22.859 --> 00:01:27.343
The Little Mermaid stared at his handsome face and then kissed his eyelids.

17
00:01:27.363 --> 00:01:33.228
"He looks even more handsome than the statue in my garden," she thought.

18
00:01:34.476 --> 00:01:36.298
"But my Prince is real."

19
00:01:37.779 --> 00:01:41.802
Suddenly the Little Mermaid heard a sound she'd never heard before.

20
00:01:43.224 --> 00:01:45.866
The tower was making a loud clang.

21
00:01:47.007 --> 00:01:48.228
The Little Mermaid looked up.

22
00:01:49.589 --> 00:01:51.390
"Could that sound be church bells?"

23
00:01:52.872 --> 00:01:55.834
Out of the large doors came a group of young girls.

24
00:01:57.275 --> 00:02:02.360
They were dressed in simple, white dresses, and their hair was pulled back with white ribbons.

25
00:02:03.480 --> 00:02:05.882
"Who are they and what are they doing here?"

26
00:02:06.403 --> 00:02:07.984
wondered the curious mermaid.

27
00:02:09.145 --> 00:02:12.588
The girls gathered around the benches, laughing and talking.

28
00:02:12.608 --> 00:02:15.610
"The humans must not see me!"

29
00:02:16.031 --> 00:02:18.693
whispered the Little Mermaid, suddenly afraid.

30
00:02:18.713 --> 00:02:21.736
"Please stay safe, my Prince."

31
00:02:23.457 --> 00:02:26.680
The mermaid left the beach and swam out to a rock.

32
00:02:28.221 --> 00:02:31.144
She covered herself with sea foam so no one would see her.

33
00:02:32.364 --> 00:02:33.845
Then she watched the beach.

34
00:02:33.865 --> 00:02:38.148
"Look!" shouted one girl to her friends.

35
00:02:39.489 --> 00:02:42.831
Although she was dressed like the others, she was more beautiful.

36
00:02:44.092 --> 00:02:47.935
She had big, green eyes and long, dark lashes.

37
00:02:49.295 --> 00:02:54.039
She ran to the beach and stared at the young man, who still had not moved.

38
00:02:54.059 --> 00:02:55.920
"Come here!

39
00:02:55.940 --> 00:02:57.381
I've found someone!"

40
00:02:58.682 --> 00:03:01.684
The girl touched his face to make sure he was real.

41
00:03:02.964 --> 00:03:06.526
And at that moment, he woke up and smiled at her.

42
00:03:06.546 --> 00:03:09.728
"Oh, Maiden, what have you found?"

43
00:03:10.228 --> 00:03:11.869
called one giggling girl.

44
00:03:13.130 --> 00:03:16.852
Then they all ran down to the beach and gathered around the Prince.

45
00:03:18.193 --> 00:03:24.416
When the Prince saw all the pretty, young girls around him, he smiled an even bigger smile.

46
00:03:25.517 --> 00:03:30.680
But his eyes lingered on the girl who had found him, the one they had called Maiden.

47
00:03:32.012 --> 00:03:34.214
"Thank you for saving me," he said.

48
00:03:34.234 --> 00:03:37.036
"He should be thanking me!"

49
00:03:37.676 --> 00:03:38.797
thought the Little Mermaid.

50
00:03:38.817 --> 00:03:43.300
"I saved his life, and he doesn't even know it."

51
00:03:44.441 --> 00:03:47.202
"Come inside to get warm," said the Maiden.

52
00:03:48.543 --> 00:03:50.004
She led him toward the church.

53
00:03:51.265 --> 00:03:54.728
The others followed and then disappeared through the big doors.

54
00:03:54.748 --> 00:04:01.032
"They're taking my Prince away from me," the Little Mermaid said from behind her rock.

55
00:04:02.268 --> 00:04:07.510
If she could have cried, her tears would have fallen one by one into the sea.

56
00:04:09.070 --> 00:04:14.132
But mermaids are unable to cry, so no tears mingled with the crashing waves.

57
00:04:14.152 --> 00:04:19.314
"I must go home to the Sea Kingdom," said the Little Mermaid.

58
00:04:19.334 --> 00:04:22.415
"But I'll come back for you, my Prince."

59
00:04:23.435 --> 00:04:25.176
And she dived underwater.
